e="pdf" xlink:href="jcb1791613.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 179 No. 5, December 3, 2007. Pages <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="179" page="881" id="N0x1ef7e40N0x3d988c0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="18039934" ext-link-type="pubmed">881&#x02013;893</related-article>.</p><p>The authors erroneously used an incorrect gel for the top panel of Fig. 1 D. Although there is no change to the conclusion, the authors provide the correct panel below. This <xref rid="fig1" ref-type="fig">figure</xref> has been corrected in the online version of the article.</p><p><fig position="float" id="fig1"><label>Figure 1</label><graphic xlink:href="jcb1791613f01"></graphic></fig></p></body></article>